# ── Data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All local/generated data (raw inputs, GEE pulls, flux-tower dataset, WBM
# rasters, cached run outputs, figures) is excluded — it's large (~1.5GB),
# and notebooks/01-05 already regenerate or re-download everything, with
# cached-CSV reload paths at each expensive step. See README.md for how to
# fetch/regenerate Data/.
Data/

# ── Class deliverables / reference docs ─────────────────────────────────────
# Kept locally as a project record but not pushed to the public repo
# (the reference PDF in particular is a copyrighted journal article).
docs/

# ── Scratch: files staged for local deletion, not for git ───────────────────
to_delete/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

